              "solution_html": "<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">कटकाद संान ्तपादयत ।</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">कटक, उपचय, कोण, के , क इयादयः भावसंाः योतष े सधाः।</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">१, ४, ७, १० — के भावाः</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">१, ५, ९ — कोणभावाः</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">३, ६, १०, ११ — उपचयभावाः</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">६, ८, १२ — कभावाः</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">४, ७, १० — कटकभावाः।</li></ul>",
              "final_answer": "४, ७, १० — कटकभावाः।",
