              "solution_html": "<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">योतशावपं तपदयत ।</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">योतषशां वेदागेषु मुखतमं शाम ्अित। ह-न-कालादनां</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">अययनं योतष े भवत। एतत ्गणत, होरा, संहता इत भागामकम ्</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">अित। शुभाशुभफलनणय ः, मुह</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">ू</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">त नणय ः, हगतानं च अय योजनम।्</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">वेदपु षय नेपेण योतषय महवं तपादतम।्</li></ul>",
